$Q_{ij}=p_{e_i^{\rm in}+e_j^{\rm in}}-p_{e_i^{\rm in}}-p_{e_j^{\rm in}}+c$;
then $V_i=\sum_{j>i}(-Q_{ij})_+$,
$H=\sum_i(V_i-\ell_i)_+$ and $\beta=\sum_rH(r)$.
Substitution gives $c-H\ge0$, with $\beta=0$ at vertex 0 and $\beta=1$
